      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He is directed to file a copy of the same with the Registry of this Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "166cddf37d5747ceb3d286d3fa7d54fe_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He further states that the layout plan for each plot is being prepared for submission to the MCD House."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "54547acec3b94dfbb8424c330345eab2_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He states that the layout plan will be prepared keeping in view the directions issued in the last order."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d54380e0274d4f53993f625313021285_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He states that the final layout plan will be filed by 25th August, 2024."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1df2cda048ea47fbb03f626930a0dee9_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "24. In the proposed master plan, the grazing area has not been demarcated as also an area for a cooperative society to enable collection of daily production of milk has not been planned for."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f97686137acd4ed98e3c4d12345171bc_56",
