      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Commissioner, MCD is directed to examine if a cooperative such as Amul or Mother Dairy or any other organisation can be involved for setting up a collection centre at Ghogha Dairy so that the dairy owners have a ready consumer for their"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c3135406996040d8ad00753851a91e69_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "25. The Registry is directed to place the disposed of applications in a separate folder as the file is currently into 3,000 pages."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "19331b63e71f4479a8d883c3d816f3c3_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The affidavits to be filed by the dairy owners in compliance with the order dated 09th August, 2024 in CM APPL. 45674/2024 and CM APPL. 45672/2024 be also placed in a separate folder keeping in view that the applicants are to the tune of 41"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "542a32f38d3f4e62bdbd5b17391c3625_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The first and the second reports of the Court Commissioner be also placed in a separate folder."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4bef8c4708cf4c50b6018d42464b0976_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "26. From the applications listed today, it seems that the focus of the present writ petition and the intent of this Court have not been understood by many."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dffdc9eb23d14c379b33f972c27f387a_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "27. Present writ petition deals with the health and well being of the next generation of this city."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "59e7494871144e6292741aa16f3a315d_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It deals with the food cycle of the citizens of Delhi."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fdbbfbdbff0047b99ef89def5fe6e7fa_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The intent of the petitioners is that animals be not treated cruelly and that citizens of Delhi get healthy milk to drink and not contaminated milk."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bf8d34e70d3143118808e556287a6bbc_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "28. Cows and buffaloes which eat toxic waste cannot produce healthy and wholesome milk."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "00eb349280134467abd00aeea69412d3_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Can we have infants drink milk from cows who are feeding on toxic waste from Bhalaswa landfill?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a47ca363bd414cc18ff78381a971d9e8_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The milk from these animals is being sold across the city to make formula milk for children and goes into making milk items like mithai etc. for thousands of consumers."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "00d6d677a8e64ad8b07fd1e1d548456e_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is in this context that Court has directed dairies situated next to sanitary landfills to be shifted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fce9da82c7d14bb6abb9f4db1dd96ce7_68",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The intent of this Court is to ensure that the next generation is healthy and does not suffer from life threatening diseases."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "184c356ec72248eb832221a381c91ea0_70",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This Court is also trying to ensure that Government of NCT of Delhi and MCD provide the best infrastructural facilities at the place where the dairy owners are to be resettled and rehabilitated by providing grazing area, biogas plant, sewag"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f1f175c9c2ad494bb9b6551481bfca02_71",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "30. The present matter does not deal with real estate; it deals with health, hygiene and safety of common people and prevention of cruelty to animals."
    }
